WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.630
Are you looking for a good show to watch on
Netflix?

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:08.330
Are you also looking to not have to explain
cults, execution, graphic language, and sex

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.900
to your kids while watching?

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.770
Well, we’ve got you covered.

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:16.129
Here’s Netflix gems that are great to binge,
just not with your children.

00:00:16.129 --> 00:00:20.910
Co-created by comedian Nick Kroll, Big Mouth
is a perfect example of something that looks

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.710
like it should be for children but absolutely
isn't.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.779
Big Mouth is a raunchy animated comedy that
follows a group of seventh-graders as they

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:32.149
navigate the awkwardness and uncertainty of
puberty.

00:00:32.149 --> 00:00:36.559
Sure, it's got goofy-looking characters, and
even a few musical numbers.

00:00:36.559 --> 00:00:40.690
But make no mistake — Big Mouth is unequivocally
R-rated.

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:45.959
Episodes examine the nitty-gritty of menstruation,
sexuality, hygiene, and teen dating.

00:00:45.959 --> 00:00:50.019
While it often offers thought-provoking lessons
about speaking to kids about these issues,

00:00:50.019 --> 00:00:53.799
letting them watch it outright is the equivalent
of tossing them into the deep end of the swimming

00:00:53.799 --> 00:00:55.699
pool without water wings.

00:00:55.699 --> 00:01:00.649
For example, the first episode sees Andrew
Glouberman, one of our young protagonists,

00:01:00.649 --> 00:01:05.780
interacting with his Hormone Monster, Maury,
who is essentially puberty incarnate.

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:11.260
Maury encourages Andrew to think constantly
about sex, fall into blind rages, and enter

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:14.409
into nightmarishly ill-conceived relationships.

00:01:14.409 --> 00:01:18.759
Big Mouth portrays all sorts of things with
compassion and insight, but not in any way

00:01:18.759 --> 00:01:21.310
suited for young, impressionable children.

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:28.939
Put the kids to bed, wait at least an hour,
and then indulge in its animated antics.

00:01:28.939 --> 00:01:34.030
Set in a sword-and-sorcery-style fantasy world,
Disenchantment tells the story of Bean — the

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:36.610
rough-and-tumble princess of Dreamland.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:41.109
While her fairytale destiny is to marry a
handsome prince and unite Dreamland with another

00:01:41.109 --> 00:01:46.420
politically advantageous kingdom, all she
wants to do is drink, fight, gamble, and go

00:01:46.420 --> 00:01:48.079
on adventures.

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:53.009
Created by Matt Groening, Disenchantment is
similar in tone to his other shows, Futurama

00:01:53.009 --> 00:01:54.009
and The Simpsons.

00:01:54.009 --> 00:01:59.350
As is the case with those two series, some
parents might be perfectly fine watching Disenchantment

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:04.229
with their kids, while others might not want
to pause and explain jokes about alcohol and

00:02:04.229 --> 00:02:05.299
one-night stands.

00:02:05.299 --> 00:02:08.750
Kids will likely get a kick out of seeing
the elves in their homeland singing about

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:09.940
making candy.

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:13.620
However, some explanation might be needed
when they attempt to hang one of their own

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.569
while gleefully singing about execution.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:20.200
As a parent, the choice to let your kids watch
what they want is up to you.

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:24.210
However, if you find yourself wanting to check
out Disenchantment and your little ones get

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:28.099
hooked by its bright colors and funny voices,
be warned.

00:02:28.099 --> 00:02:32.120
You might end up discussing the logistics
of killing someone with a candy ax.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:36.590
It becomes pretty apparent early on that Black
Mirror is not for kids.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:40.569
The first episode does, after all, tell the
story of a kidnapper who demands that the

00:02:40.569 --> 00:02:44.720
British Prime Minister have sex with a pig
on live television.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:48.909
While most episodes aren't quite as raunchy
as the series' opener, many may have heard

00:02:48.909 --> 00:02:51.650
it compared to The Twilight Zone over the
years.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.870
While that's an apt description, Rod Serling's
original series consists mostly of family-friendly

00:02:56.870 --> 00:02:57.890
morality tales.

00:02:57.890 --> 00:03:02.140
Sure, a whole lot of them are scary, but not
in a way kids can't handle.

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:06.480
Existential scares are a whole lot different
than, say, the discomfort induced by the whole

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:07.610
pig thing.

00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:13.180
Black Mirror is a show that gets into the
intimate horror of a world overrun by digitization.

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:18.739
Episodes deal with murder, sex, grief, exploitation,
and many more twisted things that can't be

00:03:18.739 --> 00:03:22.010
adequately explained without spoiling numerous
plots.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:24.640
Virtual realities are used for torture.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.900
Internet-enabled toys wreak havoc.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:30.659
Androids built to bring loved ones back from
the grave are hidden in attics.

00:03:30.659 --> 00:03:34.700
Kids have surveillance tech implanted in their
brains, allowing parents to censor their little

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.120
ones' realities.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:39.150
It's terrific, but it's not exactly kid-friendly.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:44.650
Stick to sharing Twilight Zone re-runs with
your children, and save Black Mirror for yourself.

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:48.290
The Witcher is based on the popular Witcher
video games, which are in turn based on a

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.239
popular series of books.

00:03:50.239 --> 00:03:53.910
Your kids might, in fact, be more familiar
with the show than you are in this age of

00:03:53.910 --> 00:03:57.799
Let's Plays, but that doesn't mean it's a
candidate for Family TV Night.

00:03:57.799 --> 00:04:03.799
The series follows Geralt of Rivia as he hunts,
fights, and kills various monsters and otherworldly

00:04:03.799 --> 00:04:06.890
beasts.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.670
When his journey leads him to Yennefer, a
powerful sorceress, his life of killing for

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:15.750
hire is entirely upset — and that's before
the kid destined to travel with him gets into

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.760
the picture.

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:21.020
The Witcher is one of the most violent, scary,
and sexual shows on this list.

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:25.280
If those warnings aren't enough to keep your
kids away from Geralt's story, perhaps show

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.650
creator Lauren S. Hissrich's tweet about the
show not being kid-friendly will be enough

00:04:29.650 --> 00:04:31.160
to convince you.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:32.440
Trust her when she posted,

00:04:32.440 --> 00:04:36.720
“Just watched a cut of [Witcher] with [my
son], and the verdict is in: this show is

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:37.960
not for 5-year-olds.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.510
Like, really not.”

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:44.430
You really don't want to have to explain undead
monsters, war-time suicide, and magical cults

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:46.480
to your little one.

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:50.220
Kids might love superheroes, but not all superhero
fiction is for kids.

00:04:50.220 --> 00:04:53.200
Take Jessica Jones, one of Marvel's Netflix
offerings.

00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:57.900
The series might feature super-strength, but
it also examines sexual assault, trauma, and

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.130
alcoholism.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:02.940
The titular Jessica is a New York City-based
private investigator.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.920
She's a hard drinker plagued by memories of
the car accident that killed her parents and

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:08.820
left her with super powers.

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.810
But that's not all she has to contend with.

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:16.040
Jessica Jones' first season pits the PI against
Kilgrave, the man who used his mind-controlling

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.400
powers to abuse her for years.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:22.860
Jessica Jones explores themes that are very
important to tackle with children, from consent

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.400
to post-traumatic stress.

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:29.940
However, the show isn't a PSA and often sees
its characters deal with their issues in self-destructive

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:30.940
ways.

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:34.560
There's no shortage of superhero content out
there that's totally fine to watch alongside

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.400
one's kids — but not Jessica Jones.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:40.310
At first, You seems like a love story.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:45.030
It focuses on a young book store clerk named
Joe who bonds with people over literature

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:47.120
in a technology-obsessed culture.

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:50.530
He's particularly enamored with one woman
named Guinevere Beck.

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:52.230
Will You tell the tale of their romance?

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:54.660
In short, the answer is no.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:59.180
Despite seeming to be an analog guy in a digital
world, Joe is very tech-savvy.

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:03.550
He's able to stalk Beck's social media and
orchestrate meet-cutes as a result of his

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:04.550
twisted obsession.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:10.870
And we do mean twisted: Joe kills Beck's ex,
steals her underwear, and spies on her.

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:15.050
You is most definitely not for kids, but its
appeal to youth is strong.

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.520
After all, it's entirely about social media.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:21.770
Add in some graphic language, violence, and
nudity and you've got exactly the sort of

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:25.120
catnip kids are eager to grow up gravitating
towards.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:28.240
Make no mistake, however: You is for grown-ups
alone.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:31.530
You might wish you had your kid around to
explain some of the intricacies of social

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:39.870
media, but trust us — it's better to just
Google it yourself.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:44.270
Sex Education focuses on a group of high school
teens as they navigate the pitfalls of growing

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.560
up, popularity, and, of course, sex.

00:06:46.560 --> 00:06:51.710
While that might sound like run-of-the-mill
teen drama, it's a genuinely funny, heartfelt

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:52.710
series.

00:06:52.710 --> 00:06:55.190
But seriously: A whole lot of it is about
sex.

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:59.520
Those who tune in will be introduced to Otis
Milburn, a socially awkward teen who has a

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.920
lot of questions about the birds and the bees.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:05.830
He's a lot better-equipped to answer them
than most teens, however: His mother is a

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.930
professional sex therapist.

00:07:07.930 --> 00:07:12.280
She's fine with speaking candidly about the
topic in front of her son, but consequences

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:16.190
arrive when Otis' knowledge increases his
profile at school.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:21.090
Otis begins to dole out sex advice to his
classmates, leading to very difficult-to-explain

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:24.390
situations, like a chlamydia outbreak among
the student body.

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:28.530
Now, parents should definitely educate their
kids about things like sexually-transmitted

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:29.530
illness.

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:34.830
However, Sex Education is still entertainment
at heart, and shouldn't be used as a textbook.

00:07:34.830 --> 00:07:39.030
Its focus is to get laughs, and it gets them
— but you're better off having a frank discussion

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:41.560
with your kids yourself.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:45.370
Kids often grow bored, flipping through the
list of potential shows to watch, and settle

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:46.840
on something with a fun title.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:50.220
When it comes to titles, it doesn't get more
fun than Peaky Blinders.

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:55.000
It's got a slightly goofy name, and appears
to be a cops-and-robbers show at first glance,

00:07:55.000 --> 00:07:58.530
but make no mistake — this show is anything
but kid-friendly.

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:03.660
The show focuses on a gangster family living
in 1919 Birmingham, England, just after World

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.590
War I ravaged the globe.

00:08:05.590 --> 00:08:09.460
It tells the story of the real-life Peaky
Blinders gang that clashed with law enforcement

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:11.720
sent over by Winston Churchill.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:16.700
The show is violent, foul-mouthed, and deals
with a lot of subject matter that, frankly,

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.560
some adults aren't ready for, let alone children.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:23.530
Just as one should never judge a book by its
cover, one should never judge a TV show based

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.620
on its title.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:28.330
However, that doesn't mean that this critically
acclaimed drama is a bad show.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:29.420
Far from it.

00:08:29.420 --> 00:08:32.270
It's worth a watch — just not with your
kids.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:36.139
If you grew up playing the old "Castlevania"
games on the Nintendo Entertainment System

00:08:36.139 --> 00:08:41.490
or Super NES, you might see the animated series
of the same name on Netflix and assume that

00:08:41.490 --> 00:08:43.289
it, too, is appropriate for kids.

00:08:43.289 --> 00:08:47.620
Or maybe you just assume that if it's animated,
it's probably fine for younger audiences to

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:48.620
enjoy.

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:52.970
But make no mistake — "Castlevania" is not
for kids and, in fact, is one of the goriest

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:55.220
shows on the entire streaming platform.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:59.430
"Castlevania" is really a story about the
king of vampires and demons declaring war

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:03.939
on humankind, and it doesn't shy away from
any of the darker implications of that.

00:09:03.939 --> 00:09:08.089
Towns are slaughtered on screen, and the monsters
themselves are grotesque and disturbing.

00:09:08.089 --> 00:09:12.810
There are dark rituals, magic spells gone
horribly wrong, gruesome deaths — the whole

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:13.810
shebang.

00:09:13.810 --> 00:09:17.410
This is definitely one animated series that
your kids should not be watching with you.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:22.199
For age-appropriate audiences, however, "Castlevania"
is stylish and compelling.

00:09:22.199 --> 00:09:26.649
The animation is brutal at times, but it can
also be gorgeous, and the cast of characters

00:09:26.649 --> 00:09:30.700
assembled across the four seasons are all
interesting and fun to watch.

00:09:30.700 --> 00:09:34.769
The show excels at big battle scenes, but
its best moments more often than not are simple

00:09:34.769 --> 00:09:36.839
conversations between characters.

00:09:36.839 --> 00:09:40.829
A lot of intriguing themes are explored in
"Castlevania," you just have to be okay with

00:09:40.829 --> 00:09:45.009
the heavy level of gore to get there.

00:09:45.009 --> 00:09:51.829
"DOTA: Dragon's Blood" falls into a very similar
category to "Castlevania" — an animated

00:09:51.829 --> 00:09:56.550
series based on a popular video game designed
with mature audiences in mind.

00:09:56.550 --> 00:10:01.110
It's definitely not as far down the trail
of occult themes, dark imagery and disembowelment

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.589
that "Castlevania" is.

00:10:02.589 --> 00:10:07.009
However, it's still far from a kids' show,
with plenty of blood, violence, and sex to

00:10:07.009 --> 00:10:08.540
drive that point home.

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:13.149
The tone and content of "Dota: Dragon's Blood"
map pretty cleanly onto the adult fantasy

00:10:13.149 --> 00:10:14.149
genre.

00:10:14.149 --> 00:10:18.579
With a TV-MA rating, the series makes it clear
up front that this is meant for adult fans

00:10:18.579 --> 00:10:22.740
of the video game and animated fantasy in
general, not kids.

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:27.360
Still, if you're looking for a series with
similar visual flair to watch with your children,

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.860
Netflix has some other great options from
"Dota" animator Studio Mir.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:35.009
"Voltron: Legendary Defender" and "Kipo and
the Age of Wonderbeasts."

00:10:35.009 --> 00:10:40.180
Or, if you want something a little more fantasy-inspired
and aren't too attached to the animation style,

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:44.579
"She-Ra and the Princesses of Power" is a
great watch for all ages.

00:10:44.579 --> 00:10:48.960
Hopefully, no one would ever mistake "Squid
Game" for a kid-appropriate program, no matter

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.470
how popular it may be.

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:55.399
The smash hit Korean thriller about a deadly
underground competition involves brutal reimaginings

00:10:55.399 --> 00:10:58.069
of some classic children's playground games.

00:10:58.069 --> 00:11:01.620
Even still, it's impossible to mistake the
series for anything other than what it is

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:06.709
— a dark, terrifying takedown of capitalist
greed filled with violent gladiator matches

00:11:06.709 --> 00:11:08.100
disguised as games.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:09.430
"Squid Game" is fantastic.

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:15.790
It became Netflix's biggest show ever in 2021,
despite the fact that, as a non-English series,

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.220
the odds were severely stacked against it.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:22.529
And creator Hwang Dong-hyuk and the stars
of the show deserve every bit of praise they've

00:11:22.529 --> 00:11:23.529
received.

00:11:23.529 --> 00:11:27.480
But this is certainly not a show for kids,
and you definitely should keep it off and

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:30.749
away when younger viewers are around.

00:11:30.749 --> 00:11:32.770
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:37.199
Plus, even more Looper videos about your favorite
Netflix shows are coming soon.

00:11:37.199 --> 00:11:43.339
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

